{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Two test subjects. One twisted medical trial. Only one leaves. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799100/extras/pill-loop-3_00000.gif?t=1750160764\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to Side Effects: a tense, turn-based pill roulette game. Each round, you'll be presented with a selection of pills to take. Some are helpful, some are harmful, and some are death. You never know what you're about to consume or what it might do to your mind or body. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Resist</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every pill impacts your resistance. Manage it wisely: zero resistance means death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799100/extras/ToleranceShortGIF.gif?t=1750160764\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Experimental goodies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Between rounds, you can choose from a range of experimental items and treatments that can shift the odds in your favor. From vaccines to mouth clamps. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799100/extras/ItemsUseGIF.gif?t=1750160764\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">You\u2019re not alone</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The other patient wants to outlast you. They\u2019ll bluff, adapt, and use everything at their disposal to keep breathing one dose longer than you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799100/extras/DeathGIF.gif?t=1750160764\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Would you like to participate?</i> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">This trial includes: </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A single player mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Free Healthcare <i>(an endless mode)</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A multiplayer mode <i>(2 Players for now)</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">9 unique items\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">6 pill types to test</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3799100?t=1750160764","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3799100?t=1750160764","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799100/d778ee73b4cbb6ad3e7647047fcfcb294d6525b8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750160764","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799100/d778ee73b4cbb6ad3e7647047fcfcb294d6525b8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750160764","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game display a roulette-like consumption of pharmaceuticals. "},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Two test subjects. One twisted medical trial. Only one leaves. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799100/extras/pill-loop-3_00000.gif?t=1750160764\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to Side Effects: a tense, turn-based pill roulette game. Each round, you'll be presented with a selection of pills to take. Some are helpful, some are harmful, and some are death. You never know what you're about to consume or what it might do to your mind or body. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Resist</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every pill impacts your resistance. Manage it wisely: zero resistance means death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799100/extras/ToleranceShortGIF.gif?t=1750160764\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Experimental goodies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Between rounds, you can choose from a range of experimental items and treatments that can shift the odds in your favor. From vaccines to mouth clamps. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799100/extras/ItemsUseGIF.gif?t=1750160764\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">You\u2019re not alone</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The other patient wants to outlast you. They\u2019ll bluff, adapt, and use everything at their disposal to keep breathing one dose longer than you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799100/extras/DeathGIF.gif?t=1750160764\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Would you like to participate?</i> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">This trial includes: </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A single player mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Free Healthcare <i>(an endless mode)</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A multiplayer mode <i>(2 Players for now)</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">9 unique items\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">6 pill types to test</p></li></ul>","developers":["hirohun","Mr.Pootsley","Jaybooty"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799100/00d520a1878e4b762a32c46666b6fe7d5fb5a08a/header.jpg?t=1750160764","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257151185,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257151185/movie480.mp4?t=1749746279","max":"http://video.akamai.